# A kick far too weak to bleach anything: the fields obey linear equations with constant coefficients, and light sloshes between the cavities at the coupling rate while it decays.
# Reference: the closed form from the eigenmodes of the coupled cavities, within 0.2%.
title Dark regime: grid3
grid 3 3 kappa=0.08
kick 1 amplitude=0.001
run 45
expect total 0
expect count 1 0
expect count 2 0
expect count 3 0
expect count 4 0
expect count 5 0
expect count 6 0
expect count 7 0
expect count 8 0
expect count 9 0
expect intensity 1 8 3.88211204e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 2 8 1.83540285e-08 2e-3
expect intensity 5 8 8.67750234e-09 2e-3
expect intensity 9 8 1.21227579e-10 2e-3
expect intensity 9 20 1.11533994e-09 2e-3
expect total 0
